      "blind_answer": 4,
      "confidence": "high",
      "blind_working": "Statement I is incorrect: a 6-bp site is expected once every 4^6 = 4096 bp, not 1024 bp. Statement II is correct: primers anneal first, then Taq polymerase extends them at about 72°C."
